            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï Yakopo, “Omwanïn muma nyo pö tagh.” Kïlenyona, kwomchï Esau muma, kutö Yakopo mantanyi nyo pö poretnan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.33",
